303
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:31,380
<i>What's Mizuhara doing? 
Is she racking her brain?</i>

304
00:16:31,690 --> 00:16:34,260
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

305
00:16:35,390 --> 00:16:37,680
