in heat?!

306
00:16:36,580 --> 00:16:40,410
<i>Why? Why'd it have to be a shower?!</i>

307
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:44,090
<i>Of course she'd have to think about it.</i>

308
00:16:44,090 --> 00:16:49,160
<i>All I've ever done is show 
her how pathetic I am.</i>

309
00:16:49,160 --> 00:16:52,950
