of the blue can't sound too convincing.</i>

310
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:56,280
<i>But I did my research.</i>

311
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:59,800
<i>The cost for making your own movie 
depends on how ambitious you are,</i>

312
00:16:59,800 --> 00:17:04,170
