editing, and other costs</i>

313
00:17:04,170 --> 00:17:06,250
<i>total up around two to three million yen.</i>

314
00:17:06,250 --> 00:17:11,210
<i>Campfire, a massive crowdfunding site, 
hosts around 200 similar projects per year.</i>

315
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:15,420
<i>Seventy percent of them reach their goal.</i>

316
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:18,180
<i>If you can make it to project 
launch, it's not impossible.</i>

317
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:22,980
Crowdfunding is, um... er...

318
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:25,140
Sumi-chan Memo
Crowdfunding is...

319
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:25,140
Blush...

320
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:25,140
Please Google it yourself!

321
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:27,310
<i>That leaves the time problem.</i>

322
00:17:27,310 --> 00:17:29,710
<i>Funding will take a month and a half.</i>

323
00:17:29,710 --> 00:17:33,110
<i>Filming and editing should 
take another month, maybe?</i>

324
00:17:33,550 --> 00:17:38,300
<i>Honestly, I don't know if 
Granny Sayuri has that long.</i>

325
00:17:38,870 --> 00:17:39,770
<i>But...</i>

326
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:45,660
So I at least want my grandma 
to see me performing on screen.

327
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:48,170
That's my dream.

328
00:17:49,130 --> 00:17:51,090
<i>We just gotta go for it.</i>

329
00:17:53,540 --> 00:17:56,070
<i>Do you have any better ideas,</i>

330
00:17:57,460 --> 00:17:58,760
