349
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:26,310
<i>Men really are such idiots.</i>

350
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:29,740
<i>They put on airs and have 
their heads in the clouds.</i>

351
00:19:31,490 --> 00:19:35,860
<i>In this world, most dreams don't come true.</i>

352
00:19:38,070 --> 00:19:39,300
